        logicEn: "Stream-of-consciousness base hijacking directive. Extremely fearful of The Other's desire-mask and hidden motives behind it (source of M1/M2). Subject attempts to brutally pry open others' skulls with M5 pincer-tools to extract raw thoughts unfiltered by the Symbolic order (language lies). This is a murder of interpersonal distance, delusionally aiming to dismantle all potential traumatic bombs of betrayal/misreading once and for all via absolute transparency.",
